#etcsl: line-id=23

24. {d}en-ki-ke₄ inim ama-na {d}namma-ke₄ ki-nu₂-na ba-ta-zig₃
#tr.en: At the word of his mother @wDN{Namma}, @wDN{Enki} rose up from his bed. In Ḫal-an-kug, his room for pondering, he slapped his thigh in annoyance.
#lem: Enkik[1]DN; inim[word]; ama[mother]; Namma[1]DN; kinud[sleeping quarter]; zig[rise]
#etcsl: line-id=24

